<title>POLAND: BOS JUNE NET RISES TO PLN 5.2 MLN.</title>
<headline>BOS JUNE NET RISES TO PLN 5.2 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results June</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JUNE						 1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net profit					  5.22 vs    0.44</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    9.13 vs    3.29</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 16.42 vs   10.77</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	20.90 vs   18.05</p>
<p> JANUARY-JUNE					1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net profit					 37.21 vs   18.42</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   60.54 vs   34.69</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 92.72 vs   62.34</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues     121.16 vs  117.16</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Bank Ochrony Srodowiska</p>
<p>SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
